# ==================== 全局忽略规则 ====================
# 适用于整个 Monorepo 的通用规则

# ===== 文档 =====
*.md


# ===== 依赖 =====
node_modules/

# ===== 环境变量 =====
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# ===== 编辑器 =====
.cursor/
.idea/
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

# ===== 操作系统 =====
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ===== 日志 =====
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# ===== 临时文件 =====
*.tmp
.cache/
.temp/

# ===== 数据库 =====
*.sqlite
*.db
